SELECT it.id, 'it-software', 'Review AI-written code for the bug the model is sure it does not have.',
$md$Developers and IT teams now use AI to write code, scripts and documentation. The output often looks clean and passes a quick glance, but it can hide quiet failures such as an error that is swallowed instead of reported.

This pathway teaches you to review generated code with care, decide when AI output can ship and when a human must review it, and spot security, licensing and data risks in an engineering workflow.$md$,
$j${"who_for":"Computer science and IT students, graduates, junior developers and support and operations staff.","by_the_end":["Find a quiet bug in AI-generated code, such as a swallowed exception.","Decide when AI-written code can ship and when a person must review it.","Recognise security, licensing and data risks, including secrets and personal data in prompts.","Explain a review finding clearly to a teammate."]}$j$::jsonb,
$j$[{"key":"skills","title":"The four skills in IT / Software","items":[{"name":"Verification","example":"AI-written code silently swallows an exception, so failures never show up.","what_to_check":"Read the error handling, run it on bad input, and confirm it fails loudly where it should."},{"name":"AI Judgement","example":"A team wants to merge AI-generated changes to a payment service.","what_to_check":"Decide what needs human review, tests and sign-off before it ships."},{"name":"Risk & Governance","example":"A developer pastes an API key and customer records into an AI chat to debug.","what_to_check":"Ask what secrets, personal data and licensed code are leaving your environment."},{"name":"Prompt Design","example":"A short prompt produces code with no error handling or tests.","what_to_check":"State the language, constraints, inputs and what tests to expect. Prompt Design tasks are still being added, so this skill shows on your dashboard without scored tasks for now."}]},{"key":"dashboard","title":"What the dashboard cards mean for this pathway","body_md":"Your **readiness** shows how much of the IT / Software content you have covered and passed. **Next task** is the one thing to do now. **Skill scores** show each skill separately so you can see where to focus."},{"key":"features","title":"How to use the app","items":[{"feature":"Learn","body_md":"Open the AI Lab for lessons, recall activities and the IT / Software capstone. Start with the IT / Software textbook, then do its recall activities straight away."},{"feature":"Practice","body_md":"Scenario tasks for Verification, AI Judgement and Risk & Governance in IT / Software. Start with Verification."},{"feature":"Verification Studio","body_md":"Check your own AI-assisted work: paste text, upload a document, add a link or give a citation."},{"feature":"Vera","body_md":"Ask Vera to explain a concept or talk through a scenario. She coaches; she will not hand you answers."},{"feature":"Tasks","body_md":"Your Home screen recommends one task at a time. Pass it, read the feedback, then take the next."},{"feature":"Progress","body_md":"See your readiness, skill scores and your readiness path, which shows the stage you are on and the next step."}]}]$j$::jsonb,
$j${"first_session":[{"step":1,"minutes":2,"title":"Take the IT / Software tour","body_md":"Open Help and choose Replay welcome tour, or follow the Getting started card on Home."},{"step":2,"minutes":1,"title":"Read your Home screen","body_md":"Tap the info button on a card to see what it measures."},{"step":3,"minutes":6,"title":"Pass your first Verification task","body_md":"Open Practice and start Verification. Read the feedback even if you pass."},{"step":4,"minutes":4,"title":"Open one Learn lesson","body_md":"Read a short lesson in the AI Lab and answer its recall activities."},{"step":5,"minutes":2,"title":"Check Progress","body_md":"See your readiness and the next step on your readiness path."}],"common_mistakes":[{"mistake":"Trusting an answer because it sounds confident.","how_the_app_helps":"Every Verification task hides the answer key and asks you to find and fix the flaw, so you practise checking before believing."},{"mistake":"Picking a decision without a reason.","how_the_app_helps":"AI Judgement and Risk & Governance tasks ask for a decision and a justification, and the justification is part of the marking."},{"mistake":"Doing only the part you like.","how_the_app_helps":"Readiness rewards coverage, and your readiness path moves you through all five stages in order."},{"mistake":"Pasting confidential or personal information into an AI tool.","how_the_app_helps":"Risk & Governance tasks practise spotting this. Verification Studio does not keep your submitted material, but only share what you are allowed to share."},{"mistake":"Treating the readiness score as a grade.","how_the_app_helps":"Progress shows what drives the score, so you can see which area to cover next."}],"related_faqs":["what-are-learn-and-practice-for","what-does-the-readiness-score-mean","what-is-verification-studio"]}$j$::jsonb,
'guide-it-software-hero', 'guide-it-software-body', '2026-10-22T00:00:00Z'
